- op: discuss  # 754c
  at: '2026-11-20T16:58:50Z'  # 754c
  by: agent  # 754c
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 754c
  clock: 3  # 754c
  nonce: 754c  # 754c
  message: "OWNER RULING 2026-11-20 (in session): keep as built. A Swift local's scope label includes the enclosing callable's name plus its layout-free hashed signature (and static/accessor words), so locals of overloads and of two inits no longer tie; changing the enclosing signature's parameter types, labels or return type moves its locals' ids, while renaming an internal parameter name or reflowing does not. Rejected alternative: a name-only scope label (locals of overloads keep tying)."  # 754c
